ole process  how we're thinking  you know philanthropies role in this  became a really important and speedy  exercise  that not just us but also you know we  watched a lot of other organizations  take real leadership in it and it was it  was it was really great to see  thank you for listening in i hope you  enjoyed this conversation  if you did please do subscribe to yang  speaks and click on notifications so we  can let you know  every time we have a new episode

